		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Abyssal, slimy mass. Shaped like a black, dripping sperm, with a single red, glaring eye in the tip and a maw for a belly.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 44, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +8 (2d6 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Horrific Appearance</strong>. Mortal creatures looking directly at qlippoth, CON 15+ or 1d4 CHA damage. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Light-Fearing</strong>. Fears bright light. Takes 2d6 damage each round in bright light.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d6 CHA damage. Coma at 0 CHA.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
